*CALIBRATE DECLINATION 2.11; (2.51-0.4)

;#2264 , 14/11 2005. Torben Redder, Peter Fast Nielsen & Louise Korsgaard
;stn 6=bottom of the first pitch (p18) in the cave (survex: 2264.3)
0	1	5	39	-39	;stn 1=old spit in place
0	2	20	76	-22
1	3	10	0	-90	;stn 3=floor on ledge
0	4	12.7	0	90	;stn 4=upper spit
4	5	7	255	39
5	6	1.7	0	-90
*end 2264_002